                                "sense_id": "24e138a0-7e20-31f4-853e-b3751db68526",
                                "text": "MedImmune, the Gaithersburg research arm of pharmaceutical giant AstraZeneca, is making aggressive moves to expand its footprint in China.\nThe company said Wednesday it plans to spend $50 million on another production facility in Wuxi, a city near Shanghai on China’s east coast."
                            },
