                                "sense_id": "24e138a0-7e20-31f4-853e-b3751db68526",
                                "text": "Like most of the women in her village, Ren Riqing looks after children: “This is my nephew. His parents work far away in a factory in Wuxi. It’s not as strenuous as working here in the fields. I have a son and a daughter -- they’re also in Wuxi. If things go well, they come back once in two years. Travel costs money. It makes me sad, but what can I do?”"
                            }
                        ]
